---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/site/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/site/SiteFooter.astro';
import StudioPageIntro from '../components/site/StudioPageIntro.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About VomerLabs, an independent lab building software, testing AI against real work, and sharing the process.">
  <SiteHeader slot="header" />
  <StudioPageIntro
    label="BEHIND VOMERLABS"
    description="A personal space for building software, testing ideas, and sharing what I learn along the way."
  >
    A small lab.<br />Room for curiosity.
  </StudioPageIntro>
  <div class="about-layout">
    <article class="prose">
      <h2>Hello, from the lab.</h2>
      <p>VomerLabs is my independent lab. It’s where I turn ideas into software, test AI against real work, and keep a record of the process.</p>
      <p>I’m drawn to problems that are easy to overlook: a task that takes longer than it should, a process with too many steps, or an idea that hasn’t become a tool yet. The interesting part is figuring out what would actually help, then building it.</p>
      <h2>Useful comes first.</h2>
      <p>I want each project here to explain itself clearly. What problem led to it? What does it do today? What still needs work? The technical details matter, but they should help you understand the work.</p>
      <p>That also means treating experiments as experiments. Some ideas become useful tools. Others leave behind a lesson or a better question. Both are worth sharing honestly.</p>
      <h2>A lab that can grow.</h2>
      <p>For now, VomerLabs is a home for independent projects and notes. Over time, there’s room for collaborations, client work, and products of its own. The aim stays the same: thoughtful software that earns its place.</p>
      <p>If that sounds like the way you like to work, <a href="/contact/">let’s start a conversation</a>.</p>
    </article>
    <aside class="about-panel" aria-label="Lab principles">
      <span class="eyebrow">A FEW GUIDING IDEAS</span>
      <h2>Stay curious.<br />Make it useful.<br />Share the process.</h2>
      <ul class="principles" role="list">
        <li class="principle">
          <div>
            <h3>Start with the problem.</h3>
            <p>Understand what someone needs before deciding what to build.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="principle">
          <div>
            <h3>Keep things clear.</h3>
            <p>Simple tools, direct writing, and decisions with a reason behind them.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="principle">
          <div>
            <h3>Leave room to learn.</h3>
            <p>Build, test, reflect, and be willing to change direction.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </aside>
  </div>
  <SiteFooter slot="footer" />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-layout :is(h2, h3, p) {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-layout :is(h2, h3) {
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: var(--line-height-tight);
    letter-spacing: var(--letter-spacing-tightest);
    text-wrap: balance;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--font-size-caption);
    letter-spacing: var(--letter-spacing-label);
    line-height: var(--line-height-normal);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: block;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .about-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--layout-column-gap);
    padding-block: var(--layout-section-padding);
  }

  .prose {
    min-width: 0;
    max-width: 700px;
    font-size: var(--font-size-body);
    line-height: var(--line-height-prose);
    color: var(--color-text-prose);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .prose h2 {
    font-size: var(--font-size-subheading);
    letter-spacing: var(--letter-spacing-tightest);
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-top: 42px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    line-height: var(--line-height-snug);
  }

  .prose > h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .prose p {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-prose);
  }

  .prose a {
    color: var(--color-link);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .about-panel {
    align-self: start;
    background: var(--color-surface-tinted);
    padding: var(--panel-padding);
    position: sticky;
    top: var(--panel-sticky-offset);
  }

  .about-panel .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .about-panel h2 {
    font-size: var(--font-size-subtitle);
    line-height: var(--line-height-heading);
  }

  .principles {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .principle {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-tinted);
    padding-top: 20px;
    margin-top: 25px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
  }

  .principle::before {
    content: '';
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 0.375rem;
    height: 0.375rem;
    margin-block-start: 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-text-tinted);
  }

  .principle h3 {
    font-size: var(--font-size-body);
    letter-spacing: var(--letter-spacing-compact);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .principle p {
    color: var(--color-text-tinted-muted);
    font-size: var(--font-size-caption);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-layout {
      gap: var(--layout-column-gap-medium);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 650px) {
    .about-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--layout-column-gap-small);
      padding-block: var(--layout-section-padding-small);
    }

    .prose {
      font-size: var(--font-size-compact);
      line-height: var(--line-height-prose-small);
    }

    .prose h2 {
      font-size: var(--font-size-subheading-small);
      margin-top: 32px;
    }

    .about-panel {
      position: static;
      padding: var(--panel-padding-small);
    }

    .about-panel h2 {
      font-size: var(--font-size-subtitle-small);
    }
  }
</style>
